OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation begins on red lines
OL,4,Aplan near airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public consultation is being held on
OL,7,Fplans to restrict parking along
OL,8,Fresidential roads near an airport.
OL,10,FPeople in Takeley, Essex have shared
OL,11,Ftheir frustration about rows of cars
OL,12,Foutside their homes near Stansted
OL,13,FAirport, with one saying it had "been
OL,14,Fhell" for years.
OL,16,FSome have resorted to using unofficial
OL,17,Fsigns to warn drivers not to park
OL,18,Fthere, while others have even blocked
OL,19,Fkerbs with bright orange cones.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
