OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation begins on red lines
OL,4,Aplan near airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FEssex County Council (ECC) is now
OL,7,Fasking locals how they would feel about
OL,8,Fdouble red lines in the area, which
OL,9,Fwould strictly prohibit stopping,
OL,10,Fparking or unloading at any time,
OL,11,Fexcluding Blue Badge holders and
OL,12,Flicensed taxis.
